From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: timvdhoorn <timvdhoorn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:14:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] feat(mobile): show stats for nerds in the composer

The stats logic lives in packages/client-runtime (composer-stats and
context-window), so only the iOS app carries it; the desktop composer
has no stats line in this fork. It includes the context-window fixes
the stats read: compaction counts only once completed, and whether a
thread compacts automatically comes from the provider thread.
